{"id":"0d2469f2990d6f49","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-reflection-formula.md","title":"Reflection Formula","display":"df-reflection-formula — Reflection Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-reflection-formula","aliases":["89-df-reflection-formula"],"display":"df-reflection-formula — Reflection Formula","depends_on":["[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","[[89-df-reflection-principle]]","[[89-df-godel-numbering]]","[[89-df-numeral]]"],"revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-reflection-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-reflection-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-reflection-formula — Reflection Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"841985de31202f85\" href=\"?note=841985de31202f85\" title=\"89-df-provability-predicate\">89-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"396f9d3c403d0603\" href=\"?note=396f9d3c403d0603\" title=\"89-df-reflection-principle\">89-df-reflection-principle</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7f53d84c2164d9c5\" href=\"?note=7f53d84c2164d9c5\" title=\"89-df-godel-numbering\">89-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d088b00b91690ba0\" href=\"?note=d088b00b91690ba0\" title=\"89-df-numeral\">89-df-numeral</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span> is a recursively axiomatized arithmetical theory.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)\\)</span> is its fixed one-free-variable arithmetical provability formula.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb{N}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb{N}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^{0}_{n}(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(\\Sigma^{0}_{n}(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span> is a fixed <strong>syntactic</strong> class\nof <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^{0}_{n}\">\\(\\Sigma^{0}_{n}\\)</span> sentences in the language of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> is the fixed Gödel numbering and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> is the numeral for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma^0_n}(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma^0_n}(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_T\\)</span> 是下述定义的局部反射句子集，理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>、层级 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 与句法类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^0_n(T)\">\\(\\Sigma^0_n(T)\\)</span> 均取上述固定环境。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma^{0}_{n}}(T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\n\\ \\middle|\\ \\varphi\\in\\Sigma^{0}_{n}(T)\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma^{0}_{n}}(T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\n\\ \\middle|\\ \\varphi\\in\\Sigma^{0}_{n}(T)\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma_n^0}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma_n^0}(T)\\)</span> : 理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0\">\\(\\Sigma_n^0\\)</span> 局部反射模式</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0\">\\(\\Sigma_n^0\\)</span> : 算术层级第<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>层句子</li>\n<li>这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0(T)\">\\(\\Sigma_n^0(T)\\)</span> 是公式的句法类，不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 子集的外延类。</li>\n<li>每个模式实例断言：若某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0\">\\(\\Sigma_n^0\\)</span> 句子可证，则该句子成立。</li>\n<li>不同层级反射形成层级结构</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-reflection-principle","status":"resolved","id":"396f9d3c403d0603","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-reflection-principle]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"7f53d84c2164d9c5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"d088b00b91690ba0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-numeral]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^{0}_{n}(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^{0}_{n}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma^0_n}(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^0_n(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma^{0}_{n}}(T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\n\\ \\middle|\\ \\varphi\\in\\Sigma^{0}_{n}(T)\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma_n^0}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n^0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n^0","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n^0(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n^0","display":false}],"bytes":1650,"backlinks":[{"id":"da4d48b529c5f7d2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a3a661ee56e37de5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$ and\n$\\Sigma^{0}_{n}(T)\\subseteq\\Sigma^{0}_{n+1}(T)$ are the nested\nsyntactic sentence classes used by [[89-df-reflection-formula]]."},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-387","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-reflection-formula]]"}],"outgoing":["841985de31202f85","396f9d3c403d0603","7f53d84c2164d9c5","d088b00b91690ba0"]}